msgid "Introduction"
msgstr "Pendahuluan"

msgid "What is the addressbook?"
msgstr "Apa itu buku alamat?"

msgid "The addressbook application is part of your I2P installation."
msgstr "Aplikasi buku alamat ini merupakan bagian dari instalasi I2P Anda."

msgid "It regularly updates your hosts.txt file from distributed sources or \"subscriptions\"."
msgstr "Aplikasi ini secara berkala memperbarui file hosts.txt Anda dari sumber yang tersebar atau \"langganan\"."

msgid "Subscribing to additional sites is easy, just add them to your <a href=\"subscriptions\">subscriptions</a> file."
msgstr "Berlangganan ke situs tambahan mudah dilakukan, cukup tambahkan ke file <a href=\"subscriptions\">langganan</a> Anda."

msgid "For more information on naming in I2P, see <a href=\"http://i2p-projekt.i2p/naming.html\" target=_blank>the overview</a>."
msgstr "Untuk informasi lebih lanjut tentang penamaan di I2P, lihat <a href=\"http://i2p-projekt.i2p/naming.html\" target=_blank>ikhtisarnya</a>."

msgid "How does the addressbook application work?"
msgstr "Bagaimana cara kerja aplikasi buku alamat?"

msgid "The addressbook application regularly polls your subscriptions and merges their content into your \"router\" address book."
msgstr "Aplikasi buku alamat secara berkala memeriksa langganan Anda dan menggabungkan isinya ke dalam buku alamat \"router\"."

msgid "Then it merges your \"master\" address book into the router address book as well."
msgstr "Kemudian buku alamat \"master\" Anda juga digabungkan ke dalam buku alamat router."

msgid "If configured, the router address book is now written to the \"published\" address book, which will be publicly available if you are running an eepsite."
msgstr "Jika dikonfigurasi, buku alamat router sekarang ditulis ke buku alamat \"terbit\", yang akan tersedia secara publik jika Anda menjalankan sebuah eepsite."

msgid "The router also uses a private address book, which is not merged or published."
msgstr "Router juga menggunakan buku alamat privat, yang tidak digabungkan maupun diterbitkan."

msgid "Hosts in the private address book can be accessed by you but their addresses are never distributed to others."
msgstr "Host di dalam buku alamat privat dapat Anda akses, tetapi alamatnya tidak pernah dibagikan kepada orang lain."

msgid "The private address book can also be used for aliases of hosts in your other address books."
msgstr "Buku alamat privat juga dapat digunakan untuk alias host di buku alamat Anda yang lain."

msgid "subscription log"
msgstr "log langganan"

msgid "Subscription Log"
msgstr "Log Langganan"

msgid "Most recent (excluding bad domains)"
msgstr "Terbaru (tidak termasuk domain buruk)"

msgid "subscriptions"
msgstr "langganan"

msgid "The subscription file contains a list of i2p URLs."
msgstr "File langganan berisi daftar URL i2p."

msgid "The addressbook application regularly checks this list for new eepsites."
msgstr "Aplikasi buku alamat secara berkala memeriksa daftar ini untuk mencari eepsite baru."

msgid "Those URLs refer to published hosts.txt files."
msgstr "URL tersebut menunjuk ke file hosts.txt yang telah diterbitkan."

msgid "See the FAQ for a list of subscription URLs."
msgstr "Lihat FAQ untuk daftar URL langganan."
